<title>USA: Cablevision to redeem 10-3/4 pct debentures.</title>
<headline>Cablevision to redeem 10-3/4 pct debentures.</headline>
<dateline>WOODBURY, N.Y. 1997-06-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Cablevision Systems Corp said Wednesday it plans to redeem its 10-3/4 percent senior subordinated debentures due 2004.</p>
<p>The notes are to redeemed July 25, 1997 at a redemption price of 103.071 percent of the principal amount plus accrued interest, the company said.</p>
<p>Cablevision is the sixth largest operator of cable television systems in the United States.</p>
